</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="12f1cf6c-ea32-aeaa-92ba-814c5a0550f1" class="info-v-wrap-h s"><div class="info-v-wrap"><div id="features" class="container full rel"><div class="info-v-info-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-top"><div class="section-name"><div class="section-name-left set-2"><div class="bt-mono-2">Interceptor</div><div class="section-name-left_border"></div></div><div class="section-name-right">Zirka</div></div><div class="step-1-bot-bot s"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h2">All Ukrainian interception experience in one system</h2></div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-1"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item set-1"><div class="or">A.</div><div>Automatic target detection</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text set-1">An algorithm trained on thousands of real-world strikes by Shahed drones is capable of detecting targets at a distance of up to 1 km.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-2"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">B.</div><div>Auto-guidance system</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">The system’s machine vision increases interception effectiveness against highly maneuverable targets by up to 60%.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-3"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div classon" class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">C.</div><div>Combat-proven technology</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">Built on battlefield-tested solutions, Zirka has already intercepted dozens of Shahed threats in real combat conditions.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cv" data-w-id="12f1cf6c-ea32-aeaa-92ba-814c5a0550f1" class="info-v-wrap-h s"><div class="info-v-wrap"><div id="effectiveness" class="number-sec"><div class="container full"><div class="num-sec-wrap"><div class="cent-text"><div class="h2block"><p class="h2 t-white t-grey">Launches</p><div id="regionMask" class="h2 mask reveal"><div id="regionA" class="line t-grey">Ukraine</div><div id="regionB" class="line t-grey">Middle East</div></div></div><div class="index h2"><div class="mask reveal"><div id="idxA" class="line t-grey">2</div><div id="idxB" class="line t-grey">0</div></div></div><div id="digits" class="digits"><div class="slot slot-leading"><div class="strip"><div class="d">2</div><div class="d"></div></div><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div><div class="d">0</div></div><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div></div></div><div class="slot slot-rolling"><div class="strip"><div class="d">9</div><div class="d">9</div></div><div class="strip"><div class="d">2</div><div class="d">9</div></div><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div><div class="d">0</div></div></div><div class="slot slot-space"></div><div class="slot slot-zero"><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div></div></div><div class="slot slot-zero"><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div></div></div><div class="slot slot-zero"><div class="strip"><div class="d">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="features" class="info-v-wrap-h s"><div class="info-v-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-top"><div class="section-name"><div class="section-name-left set-2"><div class="bt-mono-2">Interceptor</div><div class="section-name-left_border"></div></div><div class="section-name-right">Zirka</div></div><div class="step-1-bot-bot s"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h2">All Ukrainian interception experience in one system</h2></div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-1"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item set-1"><div class="or">A.</div><div>Automatic target detection</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text set-1">An algorithm trained on thousands of real-world strikes by Shahed drones is capable of detecting targets at a distance of up to 1 km.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-2"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">B.</div><div>Auto-guidance system</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">The system’s machine vision increases interception effectiveness against highly maneuverable targets by up to 60%.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-3"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">C.</div><div>Combat-proven technology</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">Built on battlefield-tested solutions, Zirka has already intercepted dozens of Shahed threats in real combat conditions.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="system" class="card-h"><div id="threat" class="card-st"><div class="container"><div class="card-wr"><div id="w-node-f0cf16f4-a5ed-0d63-f24f-9d3764a9cd82-7ece655a" class="card-wr-left"><div class="card-wr-left-left-border"></div><div class="card-wr-left-right-line"><div class="card-wr-left-right-line-active"></div><div class="card-wr-left-right-line-active-copy"></div></div><div class="card-wr-left-top"><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-1">01</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-2">02</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-3">03</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-4">04</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-5">05</div></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot"><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6563_icon_(2).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-cr"/><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-1"><h2 delay="0.4" data-text-fade-in="" class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">First strikes on Ukraine</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">The use of Iranian UAV, Shahed-136, began with attacks on Ukraine in October 2022. These were massive kamikaze drones with pre-programmed flight paths that targeted civilian infrastructure.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-2"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">Geran-2: Russia’s adaptation of Shahed</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">In recent years, Russia has scaled up mass production for drone upgrades. The warhead can now reach up to 90 kg, the flight range exceeds 1,000 km, and the system can be remotely controlled in real time, functioning similarly to a large FPV drone.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-3"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">From drone to terror platform</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">Today, Shahed-type UAVs perform both strike and reconnaissance missions, evolving into versatile terror platforms that threaten civilian and military assets alike.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-4"><h2 delay="0.4" data-text-fade-in="" class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">New modifications</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">New modifications of the Shahed drone are rapidly emerging, featuring enhanced avionics, increased payload capacity, and extended flight ranges that challenge traditional air defense systems.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-5"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">Countermeasure development</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">Ongoing research focuses on developing effective countermeasures against Shahed-type UAVs, including electronic warfare solutions and kinetic interceptors.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right"><div class="card-wr-right-item set-1"><div class="card-wr-right-item-icon"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-content"><h2 class="card-wr-right-item-h">Maximum Impact</h2><p class="card-wr-right-item-p">Maximum destruction radius with minimal resource investment.</p></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-2"><div class="card-wr-right-item-icon"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-content"><h2 class="card-wr-right-item-h">Real-Time Control</h2><p class="card-wr-right-item-p">Remote control capabilities allow operators to adjust flight paths mid-air.</p></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-3"><div class="card-wr-right-item-icon"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-content"><h2 class="card-wr-right-item-h">Area Denial</h2><p class="card-wr-right-item-p">Extended range enables denial of large territorial areas.</p></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-4"><div class="card-wr-right-item-icon"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-content"><h2 class="card-wr-right-item-h">Adaptive Strategies</h2><p class="card-wr-right-item-p">Algorithms adapt to evolving drone threats and tactics.</p></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-5"><div class="card-wr-right-item-icon"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-content"><h2 class="card-wr-right-item-h">Proven Results</h2><p class="card-wr-right-item-p">Interception success rates validated by combat experience.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gradient"></div><div class="canvas-wrapper"><canvas id="canvas" class="canvas"></canvas><div class="list-img-1 w-embed w-script"></div><div class="list-img-1 w-embed w-script"></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><!--
